Licensing of this repository
============================

This repository mixes material under different licences. Each directory is
covered as follows. Full licence texts are in LICENSES/.

1. Patches to upstream projects keep the licence of the project they apply to,
   and of the files they modify:

     patches/linux/, topics/*/{ours,carried,local}/*.patch
         Linux kernel: GPL-2.0-only, with the kernel's own exceptions and
         per-file SPDX identifiers (for example "GPL-2.0-only WITH
         Linux-syscall-note" for uAPI headers, and "(GPL-2.0+ OR MIT)" for many
         device trees). See COPYING and LICENSES/ in the Linux source tree.
     patches/u-boot/, patches/upstream/u-boot/
         U-Boot: GPL-2.0+ (per-file SPDX identifiers).
     patches/tf-a/
         Trusted Firmware-A: BSD-3-Clause.

   Patches in topics/*/carried/ were written by the people named in their
   From: lines. They are reproduced unchanged from public mailing lists or
   public git trees, as their licences allow, so that the work here can be
   reproduced. Copyright stays with their authors.

2. Everything else written for this project: scripts/, tools/, install-deps.sh,
   overlay/, cidata/, the test tools under topics/*/notes/, and the
   documentation (README.md, STATUS.md, docs/, topics/*/README.md and notes/):

     SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-only
     Copyright (c) 2026 Arun Iyengar

   GPL-2.0-only, matching the kernel that most of this work targets.

3. Not included: no third-party source trees, vendor (Rockchip BSP/MPP) code,
   firmware or DDR blobs (rkbin), schematics, manuals, mailing-list archives or
   test media are distributed here. The build scripts fetch what the build
   needs from the public locations listed in docs/SOURCES.md, under those
   projects' own licences. In particular, the rkbin DDR initialisation blob
   used by scripts/build-uboot.sh is under Rockchip's licence in the rkbin
   repository.
